{
  "script_id": "thomas-attractor",
  "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
  "voice_key": "yunxi",
  "files": [
    {
      "script_id": "thomas-attractor",
      "section_id": "intro",
      "line_id": "intro-1",
      "filename": "intro-intro-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/thomas-attractor/yunxi/intro-intro-1.mp3",
      "duration": 2.75,
      "size": 43920,
      "text": "托马斯系统的结构很好懂：每个变量被下一个变量的正弦驱动，同时被自己的阻尼拖住。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "thomas-attractor",
      "section_id": "intro",
      "line_id": "intro-2",
      "filename": "intro-intro-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/thomas-attractor/yunxi/intro-intro-2.mp3",
      "duration": 2.87,
      "size": 45936,
      "text": "驱动项让系统想动，阻尼项让系统想停。两股力量的强弱由一个参数 b 控制。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "thomas-attractor",
      "section_id": "intro",
      "line_id": "intro-3",
      "filename": "intro-intro-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/thomas-attractor/yunxi/intro-intro-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.79,
      "size": 60624,
      "text": "妙处在于，只调这一个参数，系统会走完动力系统的三种典型状态。这在同一个方程里看全，机会不多。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "thomas-attractor",
      "section_id": "damped",
      "line_id": "dm-1",
      "filename": "damped-dm-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/thomas-attractor/yunxi/damped-dm-1.mp3",
      "duration": 2.66,
      "size": 42624,
      "text": "先把 b 调大，比如零点五。阻尼压倒驱动，所有轨道都被拉向原点。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "thomas-attractor",
      "section_id": "damped",
      "line_id": "dm-2",
      "filename": "damped-dm-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/thomas-attractor/yunxi/damped-dm-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.54,
      "size": 56592,
      "text": "李雅普诺夫指数是负零点三四，明确的负值。轨道尺度趋于零，系统最终静止在不动点上。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "thomas-attractor",
      "section_id": "damped",
      "line_id": "dm-3",
      "filename": "damped-dm-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/thomas-attractor/yunxi/damped-dm-3.mp3",
      "duration": 2.89,
      "size": 46224,
      "text": "这时系统完全可预测：无论从哪出发，结局都一样。没有任何混沌。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "thomas-attractor",
      "section_id": "cycle",
      "line_id": "cy-1",
      "filename": "cycle-cy-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/thomas-attractor/yunxi/cycle-cy-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.41,
      "size": 54576,
      "text": "把 b 降到零点三二左右，情况变了。轨道不再收缩到点，而是落在一个闭合的环上反复循环。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "thomas-attractor",
      "section_id": "cycle",
      "line_id": "cy-2",
      "filename": "cycle-cy-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/thomas-attractor/yunxi/cycle-cy-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.36,
      "size": 53712,
      "text": "这叫极限环，是周期运动。李雅普诺夫指数几乎正好是零，处在混沌与收敛的临界线上。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "thomas-attractor",
      "section_id": "cycle",
      "line_id": "cy-3",
      "filename": "cycle-cy-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/thomas-attractor/yunxi/cycle-cy-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.38,
      "size": 54000,
      "text": "极限环仍然可预测，只是变成了周期性的可预测。系统有了持续的振荡，但没有随机性。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "thomas-attractor",
      "section_id": "chaos",
      "line_id": "ch-1",
      "filename": "chaos-ch-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/thomas-attractor/yunxi/chaos-ch-1.mp3",
      "duration": 2.83,
      "size": 45216,
      "text": "继续把 b 降到零点二零八。轨道彻底放弃了周期性，开始在空间里不规则地缠绕。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "thomas-attractor",
      "section_id": "chaos",
      "line_id": "ch-2",
      "filename": "chaos-ch-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/thomas-attractor/yunxi/chaos-ch-2.mp3",
      "duration": 2.98,
      "size": 47664,
      "text": "李雅普诺夫指数转为正零点零三一。相邻轨道指数分离，长期预测变得不可能。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "thomas-attractor",
      "section_id": "chaos",
      "line_id": "ch-3",
      "filename": "chaos-ch-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/thomas-attractor/yunxi/chaos-ch-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.57,
      "size": 57168,
      "text": "b 再往下降到零点一，指数升到零点零七八，轨道范围也从八点五扩大到十八点五。混沌越来越强。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "thomas-attractor",
      "section_id": "bounded",
      "line_id": "bd-1",
      "filename": "bounded-bd-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/thomas-attractor/yunxi/bounded-bd-1.mp3",
      "duration": 2.15,
      "size": 34416,
      "text": "有个问题值得想：驱动项一直在推，轨道为什么不飞到无穷远？"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "thomas-attractor",
      "section_id": "bounded",
      "line_id": "bd-2",
      "filename": "bounded-bd-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/thomas-attractor/yunxi/bounded-bd-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.73,
      "size": 59616,
      "text": "因为正弦函数的值永远在正负一之间。当坐标大到让阻尼项超过一时，那个方向的导数必定把它拉回来。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "thomas-attractor",
      "section_id": "bounded",
      "line_id": "bd-3",
      "filename": "bounded-bd-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/thomas-attractor/yunxi/bounded-bd-3.mp3",
      "duration": 4.13,
      "size": 66096,
      "text": "由此得到一个估计：轨道被限制在坐标绝对值不超过一除以 b 的立方体内。b 越小盒子越大，这正是范围扩大的原因。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "thomas-attractor",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "sum-1",
      "filename": "summary-sum-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/thomas-attractor/yunxi/summary-sum-1.mp3",
      "duration": 2.74,
      "size": 43776,
      "text": "第一，托马斯系统由正弦循环耦合而成，阻尼参数 b 控制全局行为。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "thomas-attractor",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "sum-2",
      "filename": "summary-sum-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/thomas-attractor/yunxi/summary-sum-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.44,
      "size": 55008,
      "text": "第二，b 从大到小依次给出不动点、极限环、混沌三种状态，李雅普诺夫指数从负到零到正。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "thomas-attractor",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "sum-3",
      "filename": "summary-sum-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/thomas-attractor/yunxi/summary-sum-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.53,
      "size": 56448,
      "text": "第三，正弦有界保证轨道困在边长约二除以 b 的盒子里，不会发散。感谢观看，我们下次再见。"
    }
  ],
